        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Endai, mũkakũlye Yeova kwondũ wakwa, na kwondũ wa andũ, na kwondũ wa Yuta onthe, ũndũ wa ndeto sya ĩvuku yĩĩ yĩla yonekete; nũndũ ũthilĩku wa Yeova nĩ mũnene ũla ũtwakanĩe, nĩkwĩthĩwa aaĩthe maitũ matyaaĩthukĩĩsya ndeto sya ĩvuku yĩĩ, makeka kwĩanana na w’onthe ũla ũandĩkĩtwe ũndũ witũ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
